# ESRS Cost Assessment CSV Output Schema
# Feature: 001-esrs-e1-simulation
# Date: 2025-11-14

## Output CSV Columns

| Column Name | Data Type | Required | Description | Example |
|-------------|-----------|----------|-------------|---------|
| calculation_id | string | Yes | Unique calculation run identifier | "CALC_20251114_001" |
| company_id | string | Yes | Company identifier from database | "ACME_CORP" |
| company_name | string | Yes | Company legal name | "ACME Corporation" |
| scenario_id | string | Yes | Scenario used for calculation | "IEA_NZ2050" |
| scenario_name | string | Yes | Human-readable scenario name | "IEA Net Zero 2050" |
| esrs_topic | string | Yes | ESRS environmental topic | "E1", "E2", "E3", "E4", or "E5" |
| cost_category | string | Yes | Type of cost | "carbon_pricing", "transition", "physical_risk", or "compliance" |
| calculated_cost_eur | float | Yes | Estimated cost in euros | 1250000.50 |
| ci_lower_eur | float | Yes | Confidence interval lower bound | 1000000.00 |
| ci_upper_eur | float | Yes | Confidence interval upper bound | 1500000.00 |
| confidence_level_pct | integer | Yes | Confidence level used | 90, 95, or 99 |
| top_influence_factor_1 | string | No | Most significant influence factor | "EU_ETS_Carbon_Price" |
| top_influence_factor_1_contribution_pct | float | No | Contribution to cost | 45.2 |
| top_influence_factor_2 | string | No | Second most significant factor | "Energy_Price_Industrial" |
| top_influence_factor_2_contribution_pct | float | No | Contribution to cost | 28.7 |
| top_influence_factor_3 | string | No | Third most significant factor | "Regulatory_Compliance_Stringency" |
| top_influence_factor_3_contribution_pct | float | No | Contribution to cost | 15.1 |
| suspicious_value_flag | boolean | Yes | True if flagged for review | TRUE or FALSE |
| suspicious_value_reason | string | No | Reason for flag if applicable | "Negative cost detected: -50000 EUR" |
| data_quality_warning | string | No | Warning if input data was sparse | "Scope 3 data imputed (60% missing)" |
| calculation_timestamp | datetime | Yes | ISO 8601 timestamp | "2025-11-14T10:30:45Z" |
| methodology_reference | string | Yes | Link to calculation methodology | "ESRS_E1_Carbon_Pricing_Method_v1.0" |

## CSV Format Requirements

- **Encoding**: UTF-8
- **Delimiter**: Comma (`,`)
- **Quote Character**: Double quote (`"`)
- **Header Row**: Required (column names as specified above)
- **Line Terminator**: CRLF (`\r\n`) or LF (`\n`)
- **Decimal Separator**: Period (`.`)
- **Boolean Values**: `TRUE` or `FALSE` (uppercase)
- **Null Values**: Empty string (no quotes)
- **Datetime Format**: ISO 8601 (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ)

